# Chaos Ideas

## Idea 1
Name:
Random Balance Mutations
Description:
Every 30 seconds, all player balances get multiplied by a random factor (0.5x to 2x)
Player interaction:
Players must watch the clock and move currency before it decays or multiply unexpectedly
Why it could be fun:
Creates hilarious chaos when someone's carefully hoarded fortune vanishes overnight
Implementation scope:
Add a timer in CurrencyService that broadcasts to all players and updates their wallet balance

## Idea 2
Name:
Time-Decay Currency
Description:
Currency decays 1% every 5 minutes if not spent or moved
Player interaction:
Players must actively use or transfer their currency to prevent it from disappearing
Why it could be fun:
Forces active gameplay and creates urgency around resource management
Implementation scope:
Add decay timer to CurrencyService that checks wallet activity timestamp and applies decay

## Idea 3
Name:
Stealable Balances
Description:
Players can steal up to 10% of another player's balance with 25% success chance
Player interaction:
Players can attempt to steal from each other, adding risk/reward social dynamics
Why it could be fun:
Creates emergent social chaos where players might team up or become enemies
Implementation scope:
Add steal() method to CurrencyService that checks balance and applies random success/failure
